     "<div><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"新細明體\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Times New Roman\">Hi friend,</font></span></font></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"Times New Roman\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></font> </p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">1. </font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">安裝</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"> R </font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">之後會有</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">8</font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">本電子書</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">, </font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">其中 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">R-data.pdf  </font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">有介紹資料的匯入與匯出</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">. </font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">操作如下</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">: R</font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">主控臺</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"> \\ </font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">輔助</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"> \\ </font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">手冊</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">(pdf</font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">檔案</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">) \\<font color=\"#ff0000\"> R Data Import/Export<u></u><u></u><u></u></font></font></span></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"新細明體\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">除了一般文字檔</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">, </font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">尚包括其他格式</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">, </font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">請參考該說明</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">.<u></u><u></u></font></span></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"新細明體\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"Times New Roman\"> </font><u></u></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"新細明體\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">2. R</font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">對於資料或分析結果以圖形呈現除了一般直方圖等, 尚包括</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">2D/3D </font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">互動式繪圖</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">, </font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">如</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">: googleVis , ggplot2</font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">套件等</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">, </font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">請參考</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><a href=\"http://gallery.r-enthusiasts.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://gallery.r-enthusiasts.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238916007000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3I-Bf8OE5bzxYWJarlc3NR\">http://gallery.r-enthusiasts.com/</a>\r\n</font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">網站與其</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">R</font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">程式碼</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">.<u></u><u></u></font></span></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"新細明體\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"Times New Roman\"> </font><u></u></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"新細明體\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">3. </font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">將</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">R</font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">的</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">library</font></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">另外套用在其他環境之功能請再詳細說明, &